  "variation": {
    "seeded": true,
    "notes": "Puff placement, flame licks and embers change per cast; the light cycle is always the same."
  },
  "director_notes": "Built to check six-way lit smoke, not as a spell. The smoke column asks for six-way lighting in its shader intent, so it is lit in every style; it is pale grey so the neon colors read true. Each light holds for 900 ms from one of the six directions of the side view (the hero view), then three lights orbit together. The loop runs from the middle of the first magenta beat to the middle of its repeat, so it is seamless. The orange firelight stays on underneath the whole time, as a fire would."
